Third-party material

This repository contains no third-party assets. Rust dependencies are listed in Cargo.lock under
their own permissive licenses (checked by `cargo xtask licenses`). Through egui
(epaint_default_fonts) the binaries contain egui's default fonts: Ubuntu Light (Ubuntu Font
Licence 1.0), Hack (MIT; DejaVu parts public domain), Noto Emoji (OFL-1.1) and the emoji icon font
(MIT). Builds made with craft-fonts (CRAFT_FONTS_DIR) also embed the fonts listed in its
ATTRIBUTION.md; builds made with craft-i18n (CRAFT_I18N_DIR) embed its translation catalogs. The
per-file asset list is in ATTRIBUTION.md.
